{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters TCG Fishing is a multiplayer game where the art of fishing meets exciting card battles. Catch monster cards, battle against opponents, and grow your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS EXPLORATION AND COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover over 300 unique monster cards. Catch these special creatures hidden inside oysters, expand your collection, and find the most valuable cards. Each monster card has its own unique powers like electricity, water, fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/card.gif?t=1740646779\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER AND EVOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your equipment to catch rarer and more powerful monsters. Increase your hunting chances with special fishing rods, baits, and fishing poles. Each new equipment increases the chance of catching more valuable cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/fishing.gif?t=1740646779\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLE YOUR OPPONENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your powerful deck and engage in intense battles with other players. Defeat your opponents in strategic card battles, gain experience, and take your place among the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/spin.gif?t=1740646779\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOCIALIZE AND CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet other players, build friendships, and enjoy friendly competition. Customize your character with special outfits and accessories, create your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/characters.gif?t=1740646779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454620?t=1740646779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454620?t=1740646779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/a665024d073c51da84844ad65ea725e0af9a60bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740646779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/a665024d073c51da84844ad65ea725e0af9a60bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740646779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3544670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters TCG Fishing is a multiplayer game where the art of fishing meets exciting card battles. Catch monster cards, battle against opponents, and grow your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS EXPLORATION AND COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover over 300 unique monster cards. Catch these special creatures hidden inside oysters, expand your collection, and find the most valuable cards. Each monster card has its own unique powers like electricity, water, fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/card.gif?t=1740646779\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER AND EVOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your equipment to catch rarer and more powerful monsters. Increase your hunting chances with special fishing rods, baits, and fishing poles. Each new equipment increases the chance of catchi